## Migration Notes

This application evolved to use:
- ✅ Backend-only user extraction (more secure)
- ✅ GraphQL as single source for process data (consistent)
- ✅ Comment signal endpoint with refresh pattern (reliable)
- ✅ Angular 19 standalone components (modern)
- ✅ ConfigService for all configuration (maintainable)

